• Prepare information and supporting documentation for internal and external audits. &nbsp;

• Respond to audit queries and support the resolution of identified issues. &nbsp;

• Identify accounting, reconciliation or control issues and escalate them to the Senior Accountant or Divisional Controller as appropriate. &nbsp;

• Contribute to improvements in accounting processes, controls and reporting quality. &nbsp;

Continuous Improvement &amp; Collaboration &nbsp;

