• Identify opportunities to improve the efficiency and accuracy of recurring accounting activities. &nbsp;

• Support testing and implementation of finance process, system and automation improvements. &nbsp;

• Share knowledge and good practice with colleagues across the accounting team. &nbsp;

• Work collaboratively with Senior Accountants and other GFS colleagues to deliver team objectives and period-end deadlines. &nbsp;

What you'll bring &nbsp;

Qualifications &amp; Experience &nbsp;

• Bachelor's degree (or equivalent professional qualification) in Accounting, Finance, Commerce or a related discipline. &nbsp;

• ACA, ACCA, CIMA or equivalent qualification, or actively working towards qualification, preferred. &nbsp;

